<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Griffith Joyner returns six and a half months after the seizure on the flight and four months after lesionectomy. She has had no seizure or spell and no detection-watch alert. She takes levetiracetam twice a day and folic acid daily without side effects. She is back to full sprint training, has swum with a companion, and is flying for work again. She has not driven and asks when she can. She is not planning a pregnancy in the next year. She has had no thoughts of self-harm. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Seizures</td><td>None for six and a half months</td></tr><tr><td>Training</td><td>Full sprint training</td></tr><tr><td>Driving</td><td>Not driving; asks about returning</td></tr><tr><td>Levetiracetam</td><td>Taken as prescribed; no side effects</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

